  "descriptions": {
    "preferred": "'Issai nishiki' is similar to 'Nishiki gawa' but smaller and with extremely rough bark. Unlike 'Nishiki gawa', it develops the bark characteristics within a year of propagation, becoming rougher with each season. The name means \"develops rough bark within a year.\" Acer Acer palmatum"
